{"4903540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep Space Treasure", "steam_appid": 4903540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D side-scrolling sandbox survival game focused on pure, randomized exploration and mining. Here, the universe is infinitely generated with no set paths—only your rocket, your drill, and endless unknowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinitely Generated Universe</strong><br>No two maps are ever the same. Every jump generates a brand-new planet with unique terrains and unknown ecosystems. Your next destination is always a mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruthless Interstellar Competition</strong><br>Code Red! The greedy Three-Eyed Aliens have arrived in the neighboring star system. It’s a race against time and extraterrestrial scavengers—you must secure mining rights faster and more efficiently than they do, or risk losing everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Geological Disasters</strong><br>The alien planets are merciless. Beware of catastrophic geological disasters that will destroy your hard work, reset your mining rights, and force you to start over from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>️ Mining &amp; Survival</strong><br>Mine minerals on alien surfaces, gather resources, and build your gear and bases. The universe is fascinating, but the native aliens don't share that sentiment. Prepare for their &quot;enthusiastic&quot; welcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>️ Accessible Combat System</strong><br>Encountered enemies? Keep it simple. No complex mechanics required—rely on your gear and stats to easily overcome threats, saving your energy for what truly matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Replayability</strong><br>Randomized maps and resources ensure that every run is a fresh survival challenge, keeping the experience perpetually engaging.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D side-scrolling sandbox survival game focused on pure, randomized exploration and mining. Here, the universe is infinitely generated with no set paths—only your rocket, your drill, and endless unknowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinitely Generated Universe</strong><br>No two maps are ever the same. Every jump generates a brand-new planet with unique terrains and unknown ecosystems. Your next destination is always a mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruthless Interstellar Competition</strong><br>Code Red! The greedy Three-Eyed Aliens have arrived in the neighboring star system. It’s a race against time and extraterrestrial scavengers—you must secure mining rights faster and more efficiently than they do, or risk losing everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Geological Disasters</strong><br>The alien planets are merciless. Beware of catastrophic geological disasters that will destroy your hard work, reset your mining rights, and force you to start over from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>️ Mining &amp; Survival</strong><br>Mine minerals on alien surfaces, gather resources, and build your gear and bases. The universe is fascinating, but the native aliens don't share that sentiment. Prepare for their &quot;enthusiastic&quot; welcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>️ Accessible Combat System</strong><br>Encountered enemies? Keep it simple. No complex mechanics required—rely on your gear and stats to easily overcome threats, saving your energy for what truly matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Replayability</strong><br>Randomized maps and resources ensure that every run is a fresh survival challenge, keeping the experience perpetually engaging.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 2D side-scrolling sandbox survival game featuring pure random exploration and mining. Mine, gather, study alien life, and build bases. Battle harsh environments and rival alien miners. Embrace unpredictable roguelike survival challenges in an infinitely generated universe.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903540/e70abe10c3da2f7729c504f111ca40c0dca04ef7/header.jpg?t=1788097063", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903540/8fa61cf40595b3a2782a45e8946b7ab4c5ba14f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788097063", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903540/8fa61cf40595b3a2782a45e8946b7ab4c5ba14f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788097063", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["RoundTable_M"], "publishers": ["RoundTable_M"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1702574], "package_groups": [{"name": "default"